    {
        "text": "3:59 P.M. \\ Cloudy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nomadic Town Wolumonde, Infected Quarter, Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Folinic... Are you angry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The way they were acting, I know what it means. I know it all too well...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... But Atro wouldn't get herself into trouble. She knows Leithanien better than any of us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah! I'm sure she's fine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least, I hope...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_065"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't this place eerily quiet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Stay close.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm seeing plenty of Infected among the citizenry, but that's not the main point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was thinking about it when we fought those rioters before. This residential district is pretty ordinary in design, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've just gathered up all the Infected to live together. There's nothing explicitly discriminatory about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But the truth is they're still having their personal freedom restricted. And aside from a few remarkable Infected, most people live more or less like prisoners.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "What they have is not a prison, but an entire street of cells with a dozen times more inmates.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look here, how long do you think it's been since this bakery was open?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ew... I think I saw an Originium slug crawling around... so unsanitary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No one's been sweeping up the dust and leaves around the door. There's no functioning economy here. No daily life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand they've fallen on hard times, but no one wants to buy or sell bread? There's no public transit? This isn't normal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe, maybe it's because of what happened before? Like the shop owner got scared off or something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "At least they have the right to live, they\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shh! Miss Folinic...! Lower your voice!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I wasn't criticizing them. I was just talking about... those 'armed Infected.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think they're...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That policeman mentioned 'Sarkaz.' We need to look into that first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they do have anything to do with the 'armed Infected groups' we know, we'll have to tread carefully. Things here may be far more complicated than that policeman knows.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If the Infected are living well enough, it's only because the situation isn't desperate enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "They must be hiding something from us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Folinic?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please don't worry. Atro is very smart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been looking very scary since that meeting. But don't worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as we try really, really hard, we'll be able to handle this, just like the senior operators!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "So can you relax for me? At least a bit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aw, is little Lisa comforting me again? Why's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, let go of all your troubles, big and small!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctors, please wait a moment\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't I say we don't need any help? All we need is access...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry. I know you said as much, Miss Folinic, but considering the circumstances, and your unfamiliarity with this place, we have to take precautions to guard against potential accidents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Miss Folinic?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine... The locals may be more welcoming if we have one of their own with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's true! *Cough cough*! Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse was once Wolumonde's biggest Infected quarter...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And now, for certain reasons, it's become Wolumonde's number one protest district.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what do you plan to do now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think it's wise to go any deeper into this place... But if you want to learn more about the situation in Wolumonde, that is a good choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's just go for a stroll here. No need to rush things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd be very happy if you were willing to tell me more about Dr. Atro.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You... really worry about Dr. Atro, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We went to school together. And she is one of my very few trusted friends. Not to mention an employee Rhodes Island can't afford to lose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, please come this way. Schaukelplatz is just up ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltalley",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What was Atro doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... Treating the local Infected, giving psychological counseling to those who were suffering.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde was unable to avoid the Great Rift because of an error the Catastrophe Messengers made, and we suffered immensely for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Atro could have left, but she decided to stay. After Wolumonde moored here, she set up a temporary medical facility to better serve the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Atro... is their hero.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...She was just doing what she had to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's always been better at practical work than rote learning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. I can see her face right now, looking so self-satisfied. That's Atro.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the first time you've smiled since coming to Wolumonde.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been pretty scary all day long, Folinic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_065"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's... a lot of people up ahead. Is that where everyone is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Shouldn't you do something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Peaceful assembly isn't a crime. That alone isn't grounds to detain them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're looking this way...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_065"
    },
    {
